      "html": "<section class=\"slide\" data-layout=\"L55\">\n  <div class=\"l55-wrap\">\n    <div class=\"l55-bg\">\n      <img src=\"images/cover.svg\" alt=\"\" data-img-prompt=\"远景雾山与水面，塔影在右半，左半是干净的天与雾，整体偏淡偏冷\" data-img-mode=\"case\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"l55-eyebrow\">\n      <b>EXAMPLE TECH<br>RAIL OPERATIONS</b>\n      <span>线 · 车 · 人 · 时</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"l55-main\">\n      <h1 class=\"page-title\">从看得见，到<em>来得及</em></h1>\n      <div class=\"l55-cn\">轨道运维数字化年度汇报</div>\n      <div class=\"l55-en\">FROM VISIBILITY TO RESPONSE TIME</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"l55-sign\">\n      <i></i>\n      <div>\n        <b>示例科技 · 二零二六年 · 九月</b>\n        <span>EXAMPLE TECH · SEPTEMBER 2026</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
